g> +4</li></ul></li>   </ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">   <li><strong>DR</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"dr\">  <li>5/-</li>  </ul></li>   <li><strong>Immune</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"immune\">  <li>Elemental traits</li>  <li>Fire</li>  </ul></li>     </ul>  <br /><strong>Weaknesses</strong> vulnerability to cold  </div><div><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 50 ft</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> 2 slams +12 (1d8+2 plus burn)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">  <li><strong>Space</strong> 10 ft</li>   <li><strong>Reach</strong> 10 ft</li>  </ul> <br />  <strong>Special Attacks</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"special-attacks\">  <li>burn</li>  </ul><br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 14</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 21</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 14</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 6</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 11</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 11</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+8</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +11</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 27  </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Dodge</li>  <li>Improved Initiative</li>  <li>Iron Will</li>  <li>Mobility</li>  <li>Spring Attack</li>  <li>Weapon Finesse</li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Acrobatics +14</li>  <li>Climb +9</li>  <li>Escape Artist +12</li>  <li>Intimidate +9</li>  <li>Knowledge (Planes) +5</li>  <li>Perception +11</li>  </ul>  <br />   <strong>Languages</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"languages\">  <li>ignan</li>  </ul><br />    </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   any (Plane of Fire)<br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, pair, or gang (3-8)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>      <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nFire elementals are quick, cruel creatures of living flame.\n\nThey enjoy frightening beings weaker than themselves, and terrorizing any creature they can set on fire.\n\nA fire elemental cannot enter water or any other nonf lammable liquid. A body of water is an impassible barrier unless the fire elemental can step or jump over it or the water is covered with a flammable material (such as a layer of oil).\n\nFire elementals vary in appearance-they usually manifest as coiling serpentine forms made of smoke and lame, but some fire elementals take on shapes more akin to humans, demons, or other monsters in order to increase the terror of their sudden appearance. Features on a fire elemental's body are made by darker bits of flame or patches of semi-stable smoke, ash, and cinders.\n\n \n\n  ElementalHeight Weight Small4 ft.1 lb. Medium8 ft.2 lbs. Large16 ft.4 lbs. Huge32 ft.8 lbs. Greater36 ft.10 lbs. Elder40 ft.12 lbs.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Large Fire Elemental (CR 5)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 5 \nXP 1,600 \nN Large outsider (elemental, extraplanar, fire)\n\nInit +9; Senses darkvision 60 ft.; Perception +11   \nDefense   \nAC 19, touch 15, flat-footed 13 (+5 Dex, +1 dodge, +4 natural, -1 size)\n\nhp 60 (8d10+16)\n\nFort +8, Ref +11, Will +4 \nDR 5/-; Immune elemental traits, fire \nWeaknesses vulnerability to cold   \nOffense   \nSpd 50 ft. \nMelee 2 slams +12 (1d8+2 plus burn)\n\nSpace 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft. \nSpecial Attacks burn (1d8, DC 16)\n\n\n\nStatistics   \nStr 14, Dex 21, Con 14, Int 6, Wis 11, Cha 11 \nBase Atk +8; CMB +11; CMD 27 \nFeats Dodge, Improved Initiative, Iron Will, Mobility, Spring Attack, Weapon Finesse \nSkills Acrobatics +14, Climb +9, Escape Artist +12, Intimidate +9, Knowledge (planes) +5, Perception +11 \nLanguages Ignan   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  any (Plane of Fire)\n\nOrganization solitary, pair, or gang (3-8)\n\nTreasure none   \nDescription\n\nFire elementals are quick, cruel creatures of living flame.\n\nThey enjoy frightening beings weaker than themselves, and terrorizing any creature they can set on fire.\n\nA fire elemental cannot enter water or any other nonf lammable liquid. A body of water is an impassible barrier unless the fire elemental can step or jump over it or the water is covered with a flammable material (such as a layer of oil).\n\nFire elementals vary in appearance-they usually manifest as coiling serpentine forms made of smoke and lame, but some fire elementals take on shapes more akin to humans, demons, or other monsters in order to increase the terror of their sudden appearance. Features on a fire elemental's body are made by darker bits of flame or patches of semi-stable smoke, ash, and cinders.\n\n \n\n  ElementalHeight Weight Small4 ft.1 lb. Medium8 ft.2 lbs. Large16 ft.4 lbs. Huge32 ft.8 lbs. Greater36 ft.10 lbs. Elder40 ft.12 lbs.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":5},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":6},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":7},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":f